The '''2027 AFL season''' is the upcoming 131st season of the [[Australian Football League]] (AFL), the highest-level senior men's [[Australian rules football]] competition in Australia. The season will feature 18 clubs and run from 17 March to 2 October, comprising a 23-match home-and-away season followed by a five-week [[AFL finals series|finals series]] featuring the top ten clubs.

